# What the model is told after a question the user cancelled: Ctrl-C at the
# model's question (as in interrupt-question), then a new prompt -- the
# request it sends is the receipt (gwlog).
gateway interrupt-question.json
wait 3
type ask me
key Enter
wait 2.5
key C-c
wait 1.5
type next
key Enter
wait 2.5
snap next
gwlog
